    <url>/2026-04-15-bakaHub/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="概览">概览</h2><p>bakaHub<br>闲聊打游戏</p><p>警告：内有笨蛋</p><p>还有씨발</p><p>还会爆炸💥</p><p>还有 <a href="/2026-04-15-bakabot">bakabot</a></p><h2 id="links">links</h2><p><a href="https://qm.qq.com/q/PnglZRklg0">QQ</a> ·<br><a href="https://s.team/chat/AuwrLk11">Steam Chat</a> ·<br><a href="https://kook.vip/yBH8C1">KOOK</a></p>]]></content>
    
    
    
